      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "2011-05-30Z",
      "help_en": "The end of the time range to query. The end time must be later than the start time. The time span between the start time and the end time cannot exceed 31 days. Specify the time in the ISO 8601 standard in the yyyy-MM-ddZ format. The time must be in UTC.\n\nIf the end date of the query is the same as the start date of the query, you can query the logs that are generated at 08:00 on the start date of the query. You can query the slow logs within a maximum time range of 24 hours",
      "help_zh": "查询结束日期，不能小于查询开始日期，与查询开始日期间隔不超过31天。格式：<i>yyyy-MM-dd</i>Z（UTC时间）。\n\n当查询结束日期与查询开始日期相同时，默认从查询开始日期的08:00开始，最多查询24小时的慢日志统计情况",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "end_time",
      "options": [
        "--end-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "EndTime",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "RDS_MySQL",
      "help_en": "The name of the database",
      "help_zh": "数据库名称",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "db_name",
      "options": [
        "--db-name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DBName",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "TotalExecutionCounts",
      "help_en": "The dimension based on which the system sorts the entries to return. Valid values:\n\nTotalExecutionCounts: The system sorts the entries to return based on the number of times that SQL statements are executed.\nTotalQueryTimes: The system sorts the entries to return based on the total execution duration.\nTotalLogicalReads: The system sorts the entries to return based on the total number of logical reads.\nTotalPhysicalReads: The system sorts the entries to return based on the total number of physical reads.\n\nThis parameter is supported only for instances that run SQL Server 2008 R2",
      "help_zh": "排序依据，取值：\nTotalExecutionCounts：总执行次数最多\nTotalQueryTimes：总执行时间最多\nTotalLogicalReads：总逻辑读最多\nTotalPhysicalReads：总物理读最多\n\n仅SQL Server 2008 R2实例支持本参数",
